PASS 1: the decision vocabulary is closed: four decisions, no autonomous financial state
PASS 2: every tool classifies and has one executor; reserved and owner actions need the owner; the rest is denied
PASS 3: tool executors are dispatched from two places only, each after the firewall admits
PASS 4: owner-approved work admits its lease before it mutates, validates or publishes
PASS 5: the durable activity and the discovery run admit before their work
PASS 6: product context reads the catalogue through the guarded tool; no MCP client exists
PASS 7: the adapter map: every effectful module a surface reaches is classified, and nothing else is reachable
PASS 8: no AYAS surface reaches a production provider, a paid model, the pipeline runner, a publisher or the dormant write bridge
